{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115851","id":3243386340,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7BUiXk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115851","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115851.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115851.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115851","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115851/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115851/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115851/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/99925a3140a730522e71a593150b85c6986d7599","number":115851,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"LSP: Optimize `find_usages_in_file`","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114729 \r\nIt's closed since we used it to track a 4.6 regression. However the issue also mentions a hang which was present before and still is. This PR addresses this slowdown.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n`resolve_symbol` is very expensive since it parses and analyzes the script, without any caching. For very short variable names this becomes a bottleneck, since a single char identifier like `a` can occur hundreds of times in a script.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a cheaper intermediate check, which just tokenizes the identifier at that pos to filter false positives:\r\n\r\nExample: Find references to `a` in `var my_variable = a`\r\n\r\nBefore this PR:\r\nFour occurrences of `a` -> four calls to `resolve_symbol`\r\n\r\nWith this PR:\r\nidentifier for first occurrence is `var`, no call to `resolve_symbol`\r\nidentifier for second occurrence is `my_variable`,  no call to `resolve_symbol`\r\nthird occurrence is skipped since search is continued after `my_variable`\r\nidentifier for fourth occurrence is `a` -> call `resolve_symbol`\r\n\r\nThis significantly cuts down the time it takes to find references to such short identifiers in projects. (Can't give accurate times, since I did not fully wait for the search to finish before this PR.)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIn theory this PR might have a negative impact for long identifier names because they are not prone to false positives from the fulltext search. However I think that's negligible because `get_identifier_under_position` is faster then `resolve_symbol` by a very large margin (in reasonably complex projects).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript",